{
  "name": "@kira905/dsh-butler-engine",
  "version": "0.5.3",
  "description": "Resident tick scheduler with single-instance job locks, an autonomy switch matrix and a hash-chained audit log — plus a report/patrol toolkit, a hand-off / cross-host sync toolkit (depart / arrive / cold-merge / text sync) and a pluggable notifier. Zero runtime dependencies.",
